{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4394933e8b7f558c8938261657bf0cf8ef489d21e0f8abf7c5e45aad54518636",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06473d4d7f1b8adbeec5ef32ac145e1ba23dc09704f60a050ef9d348ca7fafbb",
      "text": "送出最棒的生日礼物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46197882a07695ad336b39e1927cd2921d1353b11c480fccdaeccb60c799f7a3",
      "text": "制作人收到享介发来“有事想商量”的联络，便赶往离事务所稍远的一家咖啡厅。在那里，享介向制作人咨询关于送给悠介的生日礼物的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06473d4d7f1b8adbeec5ef32ac145e1ba23dc09704f60a050ef9d348ca7fafbb",
      "text": "送出最棒的生日礼物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1599c53e6f9dc3e5c2e64bb6cd80eda9e60096e1345dbe973a317c900f708164",
      "text": "（总算赶上时间了，太好了。\n……突然冒出来工作的时候真是捏了一把汗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebd22a842cf11a7a3489227c2a5f4215ddf007b458c7d8fbccfe947f6efb7476",
      "text": "（享介先生在哪里呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1432207f4cce887ad3e8bab9c270391ce29f0b5be44022a754056576e00488aa",
      "text": "监督，在这里哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50047806574ba50aec61664b7e491db37c01268083de1b4d30b6fa91ae7a31c3",
      "text": "啊，享介先生！让您久等了。\n很抱歉我迟到了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b830a2fd0facd8507db78b067db7ea99a2049e30b4d9b6c92774428da27f5114",
      "text": "没事啦，别放在心上。比起这个工作辛苦啦。\n果然还是换一天比较好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a929c2c95072874aa87554b14740ae6912b56f2d75dd0f6876f5f9c9bb43bb94",
      "text": "因为是和享介先生的约定在先嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:568544984921d3b41492d86fe147ad77b18d590c9844e81ccef33649d009907e",
      "text": "这样啊。谢谢你。\n等监督喘口气之后我们再聊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7953fa3c0d3d72eb0b67fc7865387bfc1ef873dcd4578fda89256cd96ba8908",
      "text": "啊，服务员。\n不好意思，麻烦给我们拿份菜单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9543750cd405ce03e67630ac04eb0ccb419759e80d5b3e81d58fdacb5ead4bc6",
      "text": "谢谢您！\n我们开始聊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5eec1240308915b997147b62f3b4728404fabfb35c560ee2ea5667efbd7d4bfa",
      "text": "特意把你叫到离事务所这么远的地方，对不起啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498c7193f382c1deffe258f0929bb65425ac4b8cba9e5c88b82835b82e1541f3",
      "text": "如果要在悠介的行动范围之外，\n这一带算是最近的地方了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5ae127e58c9f2a2e04ae9078c4ce5f5e4c92a200d8751d13bc4df444b6ca05",
      "text": "今天无论如何都不想让悠介看到\n我和监督见面的样子嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7a6b10c255a5576bf57bdcea567c41a1943ad9bc68316aff57cceeb228417aa",
      "text": "（不想让悠介先生知道？\n和悠介先生之间发生了什么事吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74c7e0574e7a5fd9a48f0acdf2083902fbd7995aa91f9760a5cf434c818c1b2",
      "text": "监督，一脸严肃地怎么啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb8be433edfa50698f27fa3bbfe0040e0fd5323e589a1504256f03e8ef17520",
      "text": "……啊！\n难道说，让监督误会了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f72b65acda13ed8180b243dbc2bd3cce81051ce7dda4b47a19376d6cc947e6c7",
      "text": "用那种方式开场，难怪会误会呢！？\n对不起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4413105c364b5ff21392780a60720ff8fd84adf3e8e13c5e49ee5e8104619fa4",
      "text": "我们的生日不是快到了嘛？我想跟你商量一下\n送给悠介的礼物，所以才叫你出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a77899fa1641e03cba6a4444527a1824e8eada89da492bc47ac61a83b3bb9ed9",
      "text": "身边的人都问遍了，\n要是自己想的话又容易选出和悠介一模一样的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b94404761240f73a92f00ea1e04c170dbf777647cdb6fc2f564cf5913bb5eded",
      "text": "能依靠的就只有监督了。拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8445089c0c49c1af13b71185776e85736fbbb43268ff6f720ca950e8cb4e13d",
      "text": "原来是生日礼物的事啊。\n要是这件事的话就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec523d992d2070f6769673ff9477a1e1cfd713e6ef407c4ad94d71a250850efd",
      "text": "谢谢你，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6eb71464a786820ccaaa6c3167c6bff162888b40b52ffcedf75edd89fb3cba0",
      "text": "您说自己想的话就会送出一样的东西，\n那么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:633723ff7c6b796f2cc0d80b32fd5aeccb64a2d97e299dba7191f7f31409e90c",
      "text": "目前有什么大概的想法吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee76b191765eee1c6518b663e722069b24a174624164790c1b7f220dfd05d386",
      "text": "要说定下来了，倒也算定下来了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5bb683688a107cbcf9173c3bc6c2eb2ef9920248d545de8fdd6b635e8aa070a",
      "text": "我是在考虑“能让悠介大吃一惊、\n而且又正是他想要的东西”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd1785784a7f4f371f665bc0aee121c887ded49755e95e980064e72d9b32287a",
      "text": "不是具体的东西，监督吓了一跳吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:162b1b871542286c16f850902452cf392ceb4cedb1a644f80c8e5c433cb81315",
      "text": "是啊。我还以为范围已经缩小一点了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed0fc2bc780b8886bf8e8acdc0a3f760787edd61ed165e6dabcabf95857d3098",
      "text": "哈哈，说的也是。这可是小时候我和悠介定下的\n挑选礼物的条件哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a80c88014e0c250875a81779b6cd5db222844e7ac3f6aae607ebdd23a620c471",
      "text": "当时觉得这条件棒极了，\n但实际做起来才发现，太难了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f4e96146e7753326ca9f76a6fe90609f264d73eb1411df9239bdf1db8fef30",
      "text": "还有“双方都吓一跳就算平手”的规则，\n所以总是平手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6a1866a3aa1e03bb242f217060fa0945b95921ae0e24e6dd080624c0e1b82c1",
      "text": "加上一句“明年一定要赢”，\n最近都成了保留节目啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:431092d577d7a20c2b19f28d1666deef56ab24d205420eb33303314337806b29",
      "text": "能猜到对方在想什么也是挺让人伤脑筋的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cbc6d800010b01191f59bb1eabe88b422e3a3608a114ab25955d7499945c58d",
      "text": "呵呵。那正是二位的优势所在啊。现在您也能猜到\n悠介先生想要什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13b6a132b4825b56d7100ae3e1257dcaaa5551b3fce63c126426c6353b3a24da",
      "text": "大概能猜到吧。毕竟我也调查过了。\n不如说，悠介太好懂了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d657706b8fcd9c36b34f502cbbab1a95355740a25a6f46fe3df8e586703ae8",
      "text": "这样的话，您是觉得赢不了是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfcceb318dbc82527a961d5d65f2d226f4319b7fddb7223bcc6ef32a1035867a",
      "text": "嗯。所以我才联系了监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69744a176f4f1b68572576aa259bb944ff6a74e387ca46417bf465af6a6017ad",
      "text": "我自己一个人想的话，\n肯定又会变成平时那样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:031d80f0895f296b78b1426b387ed1935bafbea9546076b3eb2dd21750b01117",
      "text": "但如果这里加入监督的战术，\n我灵光一闪，觉得说不定能想出厉害的主意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11266594aa773af0f72b257a1a1298fd5e35464d09a596df74a03ca3f9c4f8bc",
      "text": "我会全力以赴协助您的。作为参考……\n二位至今为止都互送过什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ba25aead0dd6e6d58b15ffd21906a92bf17723aab9fbf2e59a819f433d7c76",
      "text": "之前的大概是这种感觉吧。\n我用手机整理成清单了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a08174cdda021200fd92433ca1196b30f5a14faed53996e84cedd1a275080318",
      "text": "原来如此。都是很有二位风格的礼物呢。\n特别是这个，仿佛都能看到二位拿着的样子了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4e4441d34bde6ac197927d43317db79a2529ba08849b20899e0f2e0465dc5e5",
      "text": "哈哈，我也这么觉得。那个时候的悠介，\n从好几天前就开始坐立不安，可有意思了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1054f9098160786cf4969f54dd310d03c016b466276489f93a0d304cdf26c9",
      "text": "谢谢你，监督！定下了很棒的礼物呢。\n来商量真是太对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f4fec4cd85db51eb3b65b448c5b491f90189e4f8ac6735c3859f10c958f8ba",
      "text": "是悠介想要的东西，而且感觉也能让他吓一跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f2cb180cc5f8e02c1191c9c54e97235a7761b1fd536fbcbad220454426d689",
      "text": "话虽如此，根据他送的礼物，\n说不定我也会吓一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d7ee384e27639a753a7fbfd23850f95f6a8a47938b2b2a03bd8cf95032a0b47",
      "text": "比赛结果出来后请务必告诉我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d4b64985f6f391e49c4a7a135b79f69610f5c88ba5b8fd5e95bd32cf5d6f33e",
      "text": "当然啦。说不定，\n我和悠介会同时给你发联络哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:594a641eef1c5f5b43578ae44989b5b1b1f2e013f69d54a59f828300797b0759",
      "text": "就像我找监督商量一样，我觉得悠介也会找你商量的。\n这就是所谓的双胞胎直觉啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:929a13bbc818981d3b0f8cca5b1fa09f90101326f9acb03a76d090edb06f461b",
      "text": "不如说，难道他已经来商量过了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8014a384a22ba6d1d2fbd5d4e985370a29e15a6510d5b8839622160aba78d41",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08616ebfbe05958c29eed6d905031698845ebd2a10815fec6e5afab1f68a7c04",
      "text": "啊，先别告诉我答案！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:912ec4214d86686db9c73741da5a8ad52c9bc794bd693105fe1de84e5580e3bd",
      "text": "因为我也想把这个留到当天当惊喜嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9705593746a75160134cb3e68b2dff45e8a51a45c18c25961d27fd878c5fe882",
      "text": "那么，监督。今天谢谢你陪我出来。\n礼物的结果我绝对会联系你的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
